  "description": "Topological quantum computing plugin for FSharp.Azure.Quantum. Provides anyon theory (Ising/Fibonacci/SU(2)_k), braiding compilation, gate-to-braid conversion, Majorana (tetron) hardware device profiles and noise models, and topological file format (.tqp). Includes Majorana 1 (Al–InAs) and Majorana 2 (InAs–Pb) hardware profiles. Seamlessly integrates with main package algorithms (Grover, QFT, QAOA) via IQuantumBackend interface. Requires FSharp.Azure.Quantum v1.3.10+.",
